124
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,520
A gente usa

125
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:11,600
a entrega acelerada

126
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,200
somente

127
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:15,160
